{"exp_id": "phase2_scierc_full_s1", "conclusion": "success", "hypothesis": "Grammar + Semantic 双层约束 (S1 单通道) 能否同时消除 rv + dr violations？F1 变化是关键：<2pp 降=完美，2-5pp=可接受 trade-off，>5pp=需要 S2 策略", "parent": null, "hyp_len": 111}
{"exp_id": "phase2_scierc_full_s2", "conclusion": "success", "hypothesis": "S2 两通道约束解码全量验证 — Grammar (Pass 1) + Semantic (Pass 2) 分离式约束。S2 pilot50 已验证 D/R violation=0%，全量运行检验 F1 稳定性和 per-relation 效果。与 S1 对比验证两种架构的 F1-violation trade-off。", "parent": null, "hyp_len": 161}
{"exp_id": "phase2_scierc_grammar_only", "conclusion": "success", "hypothesis": "Grammar-only constrained decoding (XGrammar JSON schema + enum) 能否消除 relation vocabulary violations 同时不影响 F1？预期 rv_violation→0%, dr_violation 不变", "parent": null, "hyp_len": 144}
