{"exp_id": "w5_llama_lora_scierc_training", "conclusion": "success", "hypothesis": "Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct LoRA fine-tune on SciERC — 扩展 composability 验证到跨模型。预期：(1) LoRA 训练后 E-F1/R-F1 大幅提升（对标 Qwen LoRA +36pp/+36pp）；(2) 为 Llama SciERC 2×2 composability matrix 提供 fine-tuned baseline。", "parent": null, "hyp_len": 197}
