{"exp_id": "w5_qwen_docred_lora_unconstrained_eval", "conclusion": "success", "hypothesis": "Fine-tuned Qwen3-8B DocRED LoRA unconstrained eval — 获取 fine-tuned baseline DR/R-F1，与 constrained eval 对比计算 composability delta", "parent": "w5_qwen_docred_lora_training", "hyp_len": 127}
{"exp_id": "w6_mistral_docred_constrained", "conclusion": "success", "hypothesis": "Mistral (3rd model) + OntoCoDec constrained eval on DocRED — 验证约束解码在第三模型+复杂 schema 上的泛化性", "parent": null, "hyp_len": 88}
{"exp_id": "w6_mistral_docred_unconstrained", "conclusion": "success", "hypothesis": "Mistral (3rd model) DocRED unconstrained baseline — 获取复杂 schema (96 relations) 下的 violation profile，与 Qwen/Llama 对比", "parent": null, "hyp_len": 115}
{"exp_id": "w6_mistral_scierc_constrained", "conclusion": "success", "hypothesis": "Mistral-7B constrained SciERC (full_s1 mode) - test if schema constraints reduce violations and improve F1 vs unconstrained baseline (E_F1=0.2728, R_F1=0.0366, DR=56.94%)", "parent": null, "hyp_len": 170}
{"exp_id": "w6_mistral_scierc_unconstrained", "conclusion": "success", "hypothesis": "Mistral (3rd model) SciERC unconstrained baseline — 获取 zero-shot violation profile (DR/RV/ET) 和 F1，验证 OntoCoDec 三模型泛化性", "parent": null, "hyp_len": 118}
{"exp_id": "w7_llama_scierc_ft_grammar_only", "conclusion": "success", "hypothesis": "FT Llama + grammar-only ablation on SciERC: isolate grammar layer contribution in FT regime. FT已修复RV/ET(均0%), DR残留1.11%. Grammar-only能否消除DR?", "parent": null, "hyp_len": 140}
{"exp_id": "w7_llama_scierc_ft_semantic_only", "conclusion": "success", "hypothesis": "FT Llama + semantic-only ablation on SciERC: isolate semantic layer contribution in FT regime. Semantic层单独能否消除DR? 与grammar_only对比揭示两层各自贡献。", "parent": null, "hyp_len": 138}
{"exp_id": "w7_qwen_scierc_ft_grammar_only", "conclusion": "success", "hypothesis": "FT Qwen + grammar-only ablation on SciERC: isolate grammar layer contribution in FT regime. FT已修复RV/ET(均0%), DR残留1.95%. Grammar-only能否消除DR?", "parent": null, "hyp_len": 139}
{"exp_id": "w7_qwen_scierc_ft_semantic_only", "conclusion": "success", "hypothesis": "FT Qwen + semantic-only ablation on SciERC: isolate semantic layer contribution in FT regime. Semantic层单独能否消除DR? 与grammar_only对比揭示两层各自贡献。", "parent": null, "hyp_len": 137}
{"exp_id": "w8_ft_posthoc_baseline", "conclusion": "success", "hypothesis": "FT 后 DR<2%，post-hoc filtering 能否替代 OntoCoDec？对 4 组 FT unconstrained output 跑 posthoc_filter.py，量化 recall 损失和 coverage 代价。预期：post-hoc 过滤虽消除 DR 但丢失 TP（recall 下降），证明 constrained decoding 的 generation-time 优势。", "parent": null, "hyp_len": 205}
{"exp_id": "w8_llama_docred_ft_grammar_only", "conclusion": "success", "hypothesis": "FT Llama DocRED + grammar_only eval: FT 后 DR 残留 0.49%，grammar_only 能消除多少？如果 grammar_only 已足够则 semantic 层在 FT regime 边际价值小；如果不够则两层在 FT 后仍互补。", "parent": null, "hyp_len": 139}
{"exp_id": "w8_llama_docred_ft_semantic_only", "conclusion": "success", "hypothesis": "FT Llama DocRED + semantic_only eval: 与 grammar_only 配对，验证 semantic 层在 FT+DocRED regime 下能否独立降低 DR。预期 DR 从 0.49% 降至 ~0.2-0.3%（参照 SciERC 模式：semantic_only 降 DR 42%）。完成后 DocRED FT ablation 有 Llama 双模式数据，2 模型 ×2 模式全部完备。", "parent": "w5_llama_docred_lora_training", "hyp_len": 215}
{"exp_id": "w8_qwen_docred_ft_grammar_only", "conclusion": "success", "hypothesis": "FT Qwen DocRED + grammar_only eval: FT 后 DR 残留 0.76%，grammar_only 能消除多少？与 w8_llama_docred_ft_grammar_only 配对，补全 DocRED FT ablation 两模型对比。预期 DR≈0.76%（与 SciERC 模式一致：grammar 层不约束 DR）。", "parent": "w5_qwen_docred_lora_training", "hyp_len": 180}
{"exp_id": "w8_qwen_docred_ft_semantic_only", "conclusion": "success", "hypothesis": "FT Qwen DocRED + semantic_only eval: 与 grammar_only 配对，验证 semantic 层在 FT+DocRED regime 下能否独立降低 DR。预期 DR 从 0.76% 降至 ~0.3-0.5%（参照 SciERC 模式：semantic_only 降 DR 68%��。完成后 DocRED FT ablation 有 Qwen 双模式数据。", "parent": "w5_qwen_docred_lora_training", "hyp_len": 199}

